OL,3,AUS and Denmark reach deal over
OL,4,AGreenland after Trump annexation
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US and Denmark have announced a
OL,8,Fdeal on Greenland's security that will
OL,9,Fbe signed next week.
OL,11,FUS President Donald Trump said the
OL,12,Fagreement would grant the US "permanent
OL,13,Fcontrol over security, and all other
OL,14,Fneeds".
OL,16,FDenmark's Prime Minister said the deal
OL,17,F"strengthens security in the Arctic and
OL,18,Fthe North Atlantic area" but did not
OL,19,Faddress specifics in the agreement that
OL,20,FTrump mentioned in a social media post.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
