OL,3,AUS and Denmark reach deal over
OL,4,AGreenland after Trump annexation
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe deal comes after months of threats
OL,8,Fby Trump to "take" Greenland over
OL,9,Fnational security concerns, citing its
OL,10,Fstrategic location for defence purposes
OL,11,Fand its mineral wealth.
